# MLX Swift Examples
[ExampleLLM](https://github.com/ml-explore/mlx-swift-examples/blob/main/Tools/ExampleLLM/README.md): A command line tool using the simplified API to interact with LLMs.
[image-tool](https://github.com/ml-explore/mlx-swift-examples/blob/main/Tools/image-tool/README.md): A command line tool for generating images using a stable diffusion model from Hugging Face.
[mnist-tool](https://github.com/ml-explore/mlx-swift-examples/blob/main/Tools/mnist-tool/README.md): A command line tool for training a a LeNet on MNIST.
